WEBVTT

00:03:29.829 --> 00:03:30.996
is a physics equation.

00:03:30.996 --> 00:03:32.746
T -- Technology.

00:03:32.788 --> 00:03:35.788
The technology needed to get
the best radial tires

00:03:35.788 --> 00:03:37.871
so you don't have frictional asphalt.

00:03:37.913 --> 00:03:39.496
E -- Engineering.

00:03:39.538 --> 00:03:42.121
The engineering needed
to fix or peg a dirt bike,

00:03:42.163 --> 00:03:44.746
but to also get the best "mac mac" noise.

00:03:44.746 --> 00:03:46.788
M -- Mathematics.

00:03:46.829 --> 00:03:49.621
The math needed for the gas to oil ratio

00:03:49.663 --> 00:03:51.954
so your dirt bike does not explode.

00:03:51.996 --> 00:03:53.621
Then I took it a step further.

00:03:53.621 --> 00:03:55.079
I thought about the riders.

00:03:55.079 --> 00:03:57.913
I knew the only way
to have program and solutions

00:03:57.913 --> 00:03:59.829
was to have them at the table.

00:03:59.871 --> 00:04:02.704
Because the people closest
to the problem are the solution.